know where you live...

498
00:36:55,255 --> 00:36:57,631
...and are coming for your ass.
Good luck.

499
00:36:59,926 --> 00:37:01,760
I saw the whole thing.

500
00:37:02,929 --> 00:37:06,390
I watched him shoot her
like she was nothing.

501
00:37:09,144 --> 00:37:11,604
Please, shut the door.

502
00:37:15,901 --> 00:37:17,234
Look, lady.

503
00:37:18,028 --> 00:37:20,529
You ain't got
no more bats, golf clubs...

504
00:37:20,780 --> 00:37:23,824
...or anything like that
to swing at me, do you?

505
00:37:25,285 --> 00:37:26,827
I knew Max, okay?

506
00:37:27,412 --> 00:37:30,164
I cared about Max also.

507
00:37:31,791 --> 00:37:34,126
I'm just here to help you.

508
00:37:36,755 --> 00:37:38,422
You're not what I expected.

509
00:37:39,591 --> 00:37:42,927
I ain't expect to walk
into Yankee Stadium either.

510
00:37:46,306 --> 00:37:48,933
We got to get out of here, okay?
Let's go.

511
00:37:49,517 --> 00:37:51,518
I've got to get my dogs.
Dukie.

512
00:37:53,021 --> 00:37:54,521
Lukie, Dukie, whatever.

513
00:37:54,856 --> 00:37:56,815
You got a back door?

514
00:37:57,067 --> 00:38:00,069
- Where we going?
- Protective custody.

515
00:38:00,320 --> 00:38:02,988
Fuck that.
I'm only dealing with you.

516
00:38:03,323 --> 00:38:05,866
That was a cop that threw
that party at the Biltmore.

517
00:38:06,117 --> 00:38:08,869
Former cop.
We got rid of him long ago.

518
00:38:09,120 --> 00:38:10,204
Come on, Luke.

519
00:38:10,538 --> 00:38:14,458
Listen, if you want to live,
you got to trust me.

520
00:38:32,477 --> 00:38:35,062
Run! Run! Move!

521
00:38:47,325 --> 00:38:49,910
Here, doggie.
Come on, doggie.

522
00:38:50,161 --> 00:38:51,537
Jesus Christ!

523
00:38:51,997 --> 00:38:53,038
Who the hell was that?

524
00:38:53,999 --> 00:38:56,875
There is too much killing going on!

525
00:38:57,252 --> 00:38:58,502
Go after them!

526
00:38:58,753 --> 00:38:59,837
I'll go around front!

527
00:39:02,549 --> 00:39:05,718
Come on, move your ass. Let's go.

528
00:39:09,431 --> 00:39:10,514
Fuck.

529
00:39:22,193 --> 00:39:23,444
Get in the car.

530
00:39:24,029 --> 00:39:25,738
Damn.

531
00:39:29,617 --> 00:39:32,202
- Go, goddamn it.
- Fucking door.

532
00:39:32,871 --> 00:39:34,913
Go, goddamn it, go.

533
00:39:41,796 --> 00:39:45,090
How did you miss them?
You fat fuck!

534
00:39:45,300 --> 00:39:46,800
Watch your fucking mouth!

535
00:39:47,052 --> 00:39:48,719
Lose weight, you'd have caught them.

536
00:39:48,970 --> 00:39:51,555
I'd like to squeeze your fucking head.

537
00:39:51,806 --> 00:39:53,640
Now you're in fucking trouble.

538
00:39:53,892 --> 00:39:56,101
- You get the license plate?
- I got the plates.

539
00:39:56,311 --> 00:39:57,770
You cockeyed fuck.

540
00:39:59,064 --> 00:40:01,774
This is a getaway car?
We won't get away from anything.

541
00:40:02,067 --> 00:40:04,276
Is this a goddamn
family station wagon?

542
00:40:04,569 --> 00:40:07,488
Oh, my God,
you got a baby seat in the back.

543
00:40:07,947 --> 00:40:10,324
It's an undercover car, okay?

544
00:40:10,909 --> 00:40:14,995
I know they saw my license plate.
Were those the guys who shot Max?

545
00:40:15,288 --> 00:40:18,499
I only saw bullets.
You tell me what they look like.

546
00:40:18,750 --> 00:40:21,418
I don't know. I was busy trying
to keep a bullet out of you.

547
00:40:22,087 --> 00:40:25,005
I need you to look
through some mug shots...

548
00:40:25,298 --> 00:40:27,174
...to identity Max's shooter.

549
00:40:27,342 --> 00:40:29,218
- Where?
- Protective custody.

550
00:40:29,427 --> 00:40:32,346
I told you I'm not going
into protective custody.

551
00:40:32,597 --> 00:40:33,806
I'm not playing.

552
00:40:34,015 --> 00:40:37,434
You really pissing me off.
I'll book your ass.

553
00:40:37,727 --> 00:40:42,231
Oh, yeah? I'll develop amnesia.
I suddenly feel a case of it coming on.

554
00:40:42,524 --> 00:40:45,192
Fine, where would you feel safe?

555
00:40:45,443 --> 00:40:47,653
You want to do protective custody?

556
00:40:47,821 --> 00:40:52,366
We'll do in-home protective custody,
at your place. I can handle that.

557
00:40:52,784 --> 00:40:55,035
Yeah, my place.
My place is...

558
00:40:55,328 --> 00:40:56,662
No way.

559
00:40:58,456 --> 00:40:59,498
Right.

560
00:40:59,833 --> 00:41:02,960
Yeah, my place is the shit.

561
00:41:03,211 --> 00:41:05,629
Mike Lowrey's place.
You right.

562
00:41:06,131 --> 00:41:09,258
That's the best idea you came up
with tonight. Yeah, my place.

563
00:41:12,762 --> 00:41:15,806
Wait here.

564
00:41:21,479 --> 00:41:22,563
Detective Burnett.

565
00:41:22,772 --> 00:41:26,024
How are you? Long time no see.
Mr. Lowrey's not here.

566
00:41:26,276 --> 00:41:28,402
He said I could use his place.

567
00:41:28,778 --> 00:41:30,654
He didn't mention it to me.

568
00:41:33,658 --> 00:41:36,034
Who's the chick?
How's your wife?

569
00:41:38,037 --> 00:41:39,413
Fine, she's fine.

570
00:41:39,664 --> 00:41:42,583
Your kids, they're good?
Family's the most important thing.

571
00:41:43,084 --> 00:41:44,084
Is it?

572
00:41:44,377 --> 00:41:47,754
Mr. Lowrey said you got a baby factory
going on at your house. True?

573
00:41:48,381 --> 00:41:50,841
Here you go.

574
00:41:51,009 --> 00:41:53,594
If that ain't enough,
I'll run you in for extortion.

575
00:41:53,928 --> 00:41:56,013
You know,
I'm so stupid sometimes.

576
00:41:56,222 --> 00:41:57,264
Are you?

577
00:41:57,432 --> 00:42:00,517
Now that you mention it,
Mr. Lowrey mentioned you'd come by.

578
00:42:00,768 --> 00:42:03,562
What did he say?
Did he say he had a key?

579
00:42:03,730 --> 00:42:04,771
Hang out.

580
00:42:06,107 --> 00:42:07,316
- Here.
- Is this it?

581
00:42:07,567 --> 00:42:08,692
You're hurting me.

582
00:42:08,943 --> 00:42:11,904
- Thank you. Good to see you.
- Good to see you.

583
00:42:12,822 --> 00:42:15,449
- Have fun.
- It's not like that.

584
00:42:15,700 --> 00:42:18,327
- Sure, sure.
- It's not like that.

585
00:42:23,333 --> 00:42:24,416
Come on.

586
00:42:24,626 --> 00:42:26,960
Watch your step up through here.

587
00:42:27,337 --> 00:42:29,630
Damn, I must've left
some incense burning.

588
00:42:30,131 --> 00:42:32,758
Welcome to Casa de Lowrey.

589
00:42:34,469 --> 00:42:36,053
This is kind of...

590
00:42:36,930 --> 00:42:38,305
I'm always moving my switches.

591
00:42:38,473 --> 00:42:41,475
I'm always decorating, so sometimes
I just don't know where shit is.

592
00:42:42,393 --> 00:42:43,435
Damn.

593
00:42:44,229 --> 00:42:45,270
Shit.

594
00:42:47,065 --> 00:42:48,982
Why am I tripping on shit
I know is there?

595
00:42:51,736 --> 00:42:53,070
You found a light switch.

596
00:42:53,321 --> 00:42:56,448
I should have known it was there
since I decorated the place.

597
00:42:57,951 --> 00:42:59,576
Mike, this is Yvette.

598
00:42:59,869 --> 00:43:02,788
Ignore this.
It's one of my freaks, Yvette.

599
00:43:03,122 --> 00:43:05,123
She's always calling,
got to have it.

600
00:43:05,667 --> 00:43:08,293
Don't call here no more now, freak.
Just one of my freaks.

601
00:43:08,503 --> 00:43:10,963
All this on a cop's salary?

602
00:43:11,673 --> 00:43:13,173
Well...

603
00:43:13,675 --> 00:43:14,758
...it's honest money.

604
00:43:15,009 --> 00:43:17,177
I'm a second-generation rich kid.

605
00:43:18,096 --> 00:43:22,099
If you're not in it for the paycheck,
are you an action junkie?

606
00:43:23,059 --> 00:43:24,518
If that what you want to call it.

607
00:43:24,936 --> 00:43:28,689
I don't mind bats swung at my head,
bullets grazing my ass.

608
00:43:28,982 --> 00:43:30,691
Gives me a rush.

609
00:43:31,276 --> 00:43:34,444
Look, I'll give you a broad stroke
of the place.

610
00:43:34,946 --> 00:43:37,948
I got some T-bones in the fridge
for Lukie and Dukie...

611
00:43:38,157 --> 00:43:43,203
Sorry, the fridge is this way.
I confuse my own shit.

612
00:43:43,788 --> 00:43:49,042
- Wait, you're leaving me here alone?
- Yeah, I gotta get back to the P.D.

613
00:43:49,502 --> 00:43:52,713
These are Miami's
peak crime hours, you know.

614
00:43:53,006 --> 00:43:54,214
Apparently.

615
00:43:55,550 --> 00:43:59,928
They said this deal was going down
in 4 days, and I, you know...

616
00:44:00,179 --> 00:44:05,392
...obviously seem to be kind of
a major glitch in their...

617
00:44:05,560 --> 00:44:08,729
You ain't with the bad guys now.
You're with the cops.

618
00:44:09,230 --> 00:44:11,565
With Mike Lowrey. You with the cops.

619
00:44:11,858 --> 00:44:14,234
Everything will be all right.
Trust me.

620
00:44:14,861 --> 00:44:16,486
I'll be back.

621
00:44:16,738 --> 00:44:21,033
I know that it's no time to joke,
but remember in the movie when...?

622
00:44:21,326 --> 00:44:23,452
All right, all right.

623
00:44:24,078 --> 00:44:26,246
Thanks for everything, Mike.

624
00:44:27,915 --> 00:44:29,207
I'm going.

625
00:44:33,880 --> 00:44:36,673
- Chet.
- You're one of those in and out guys.

626
00:44:36,966 --> 00:44:38,425
It's not like that, Chet.

627
00:44:38,593 --> 00:44:40,719
- The girl, she's a witness.
- Right.

628
00:44:41,012 --> 00:44:42,721
- Keep an eye out.
- No problem.

629
00:44:42,972 --> 00:44:44,598
Listen to me. Hear me.

630
00:44:44,891 --> 00:44:46,266
- Me?
- That's right.

631
00:44:46,559 --> 00:44:51,104
All right, the moment Lowrey gets in,
you have him call me at home.

632
00:44:51,773 --> 00:44:53,106
- At my home.
- Call you at home.

633
00:44:53,274 --> 00:44:55,108
use this phone.
Don't let him go upstairs.

634
00:44:55,276 --> 00:44:59,571
But he lives here. I don't wanna argue
with Mr. Lowrey. I could lose my job.

635
00:44:59,781 --> 00:45:03,116
- Chet, trust me on this, okay?
- Okay. Call you from here.

636
00:45:03,409 --> 00:45:04,785
Don't let him up.

637
00:45:05,078 --> 00:45:06,578
- No problem.
- Important witness.

638
00:45:06,871 --> 00:45:07,913
Thank you.

639
00:45:08,122 --> 00:45:11,708
I got an idea. I'm off in 2 hours,
I could go upstairs...

640
00:45:11,959 --> 00:45:13,043
...and watch the door.

641
00:45:13,294 --> 00:45:15,253
Like cops do in the movies.
Sit on the stool.

642
00:45:15,505 --> 00:45:19,424
I got a magazine and everything.
And I don't let anybody in or out.

643
00:45:19,634 --> 00:45:22,135
All kidding aside, I want to help.

644
00:45:22,387 --> 00:45:24,304
You're helping.
Do that from here.

645
00:45:24,514 --> 00:45:27,265
- Can you do it from here?
- Yes, I can do it from here.

646
00:45:27,809 --> 00:45:30,310
Fine.
That helps. From here, okay?

647
00:45:30,645 --> 00:45:34,064
It's funny that you ask me,
because I was going to be a cop.

648
00:45:34,315 --> 00:45:37,818
I took the test and everything.
Just didn't work out.

649
00:45:38,027 --> 00:45:39,069
Politics.

650
00:45:40,113 --> 00:45:42,322
- I know, you're my deputy.
- I'm your deputy.

651
00:45:42,490 --> 00:45:45,659
- From here. Watch out for everything.
- You got it.

652
00:45:46,119 --> 00:45:47,786
Take care, chief.

653
00:45:48,413 --> 00:45:49,454
I'm a deputy.

654
00:45:49,664 --> 00:45:52,833
Don't "honey-baby" me,
you smell like perfume.

655
00:45:55,461 --> 00:45:58,171
And you don't even have
your wedding ring on.

656
00:46:00,133 --> 00:46:01,341
Damn.

657
00:46:02,552 --> 00:46:04,177
I went undercover...

658
00:46:04,345 --> 00:46:08,140
...and so it required
taking off the ring for a second.

659
00:46:08,307 --> 00:46:12,144
But I got the ring. Look, I just put
my hand in my pocket to get it...

660
00:46:12,353 --> 00:46:13,979
...and it's right back on.

661
00:46:15,857 --> 00:46:17,065
Damn.

662
00:46:17,984 --> 00:46:19,484
Can I get a pillow?

663
00:46:19,777 --> 00:46:23,530
Well, if it isn't the guy
who doesn't return phone calls.

664
00:46:23,781 --> 00:46:26,366
Mind telling me where you've been
the last 12 hours?

665
00:46:26,617 --> 00:46:28,118
I paged you all night.

666
00:46:28,369 --> 00:46:31,121
We got a situation here
that you need to know about.

667
00:46:31,330 --> 00:46:32,622
Look, Marcus...

668
00:46:32,874 --> 00:46:36,543
...I got a dead madam, a concussion
and a bad headache.

669
00:46:36,794 --> 00:46:39,379
Let me tell you what I did last night.

670
00:46:39,630 --> 00:46:43,967
I had to sleep on my couch. I woke up
with a Power Ranger in my ass.

671
00:46:44,218 --> 00:46:47,888
While we're discussing my ass,
I damn near got it blown off.

672
00:46:48,389 --> 00:46:50,974
The good news is I got a witness.

673
00:46:51,225 --> 00:46:54,102
Let me tell you about her.
She likes to...

674
00:46:54,812 --> 00:46:57,230
You sound like a nagging wife.

675
00:46:57,523 --> 00:46:59,107
I'm a nagging...?

676
00:46:59,358 --> 00:47:02,569
See what happens when you go off
without me? You get into shit.

677
00:47:02,737 --> 00:47:05,655
Oh, please, like shit don't happen
when you're there.

678
00:47:05,823 --> 00:47:07,657
That ain't the point.

679
00:47:07,909 --> 00:47:12,120
If your partner pages you, you might
wanna get back to your partner.

680
00:47:12,371 --> 00:47:14,748
I want to meet the man
who whupped your ass.

681
00:47:15,041 --> 00:47:18,001
I want to meet
who whupped Shaft's ass.

682
00:47:18,252 --> 00:47:21,630
Look at me. You don't know
what I've been through.

683
00:47:21,881 --> 00:47:25,258
My wife kicked me out
of my happy home.

684
00:47:25,551 --> 00:47:27,844
But, no.
You got to go off by yourself.

685
00:47:28,095 --> 00:47:32,265
"I got this, partner, I got this."
Bullshit.

686
00:47:32,517 --> 00:47:34,768
I am feeling much better though.
Thank you.

687
00:47:35,061 --> 00:47:36,186
I'll get him.

688
00:47:37,230 --> 00:47:40,732
- I'll beat you up.
- Watch yourself.

689
00:47:40,900 --> 00:47:43,652
What did I say?
Did you hear what I said?

690
00:47:43,903 --> 00:47:46,613
I heard what I said
because I was there when I said it.

691
00:47:47,281 --> 00:47:50,784
I told you.
I told you to secure a witness...

692
00:47:51,077 --> 00:47:52,911
...not shoot up a neighborhood.

693
00:47:53,162 --> 00:47:57,374
Not to do another dead body.
Just get the dope back, quietly.

694
00:47:57,917 --> 00:48:01,461
Look, captain. This whole situation
is getting out of control.

695
00:48:01,712 --> 00:48:04,381
You're damn right
it's getting out of control!

696
00:48:04,549 --> 00:48:07,968
I damn near had to pass a pop quiz
before she believed I was him.

697
00:48:09,470 --> 00:48:10,720
Going, it's going...

698
00:48:10,972 --> 00:48:12,806
Shit, little off.

699
00:48:13,432 --> 00:48:16,268
I haven't killed
anybody yet today, captain.

700
00:48:16,477 --> 00:48:20,313
You want me to yell at you? Because
I can do that. Listen, this witness...

701
00:48:20,815 --> 00:48:23,483
...it's the only good news I got,
okay?

702
00:48:23,693 --> 00:48:25,318
You guys are bad news.

703
00:48:25,611 --> 00:48:28,738
What does that mean?
It means if you must be Mike Lowrey...

704
00:48:28,990 --> 00:48:32,325
...Santa Claus, I don't give a shit,
that's who you'll be.

705
00:48:32,577 --> 00:48:35,161
Wait a minute,
what the hell is going on?

706
00:48:37,832 --> 00:48:40,083
I was getting them all in
before you came.

707
00:48:40,334 --> 00:48:43,336
Can somebody talk to me, please?
Can I know what's going on?

708
00:48:44,422 --> 00:48:48,174
Captain, these fools
could have seen my license plate.

709
00:48:48,342 --> 00:48:50,594
So where's the girl now?

710
00:48:52,471 --> 00:48:54,347
- His place.
- What?

711
00:48:54,640 --> 00:48:58,143
You left her by herself?
Our only fucking witness?

712
00:48:58,352 --> 00:49:00,437
You left a strange hooker
in my apartment?

713
00:49:00,688 --> 00:49:04,149
The girl is not a hooker,
as far as I know.

714
00:49:04,358 --> 00:49:08,486
I had to stash her somewhere.
Her and her dogs, Luke and Dukie.

715
00:49:09,030 --> 00:49:12,657
You left dogs in my house? There's
dogs and a hooker in my house?

716
00:49:12,950 --> 00:49:15,368
Add some chimps,
we'll have a carnival.

717
00:49:15,620 --> 00:49:17,120
She's not a hooker.

718
00:49:17,371 --> 00:49:19,289
- Can you please...?
- Shut up!

719
00:49:21,334 --> 00:49:24,294
For years, Sinclair has tried
to pin something on me.

720
00:49:24,545 --> 00:49:27,047
I'm always taking it for you.
Do it for me.

721
00:49:30,509 --> 00:49:35,180
If this witness IDs the shooters,
maybe we catch our bad guys.

722
00:49:35,389 --> 00:49:37,265
But until then...

723
00:49:37,516 --> 00:49:38,767
...until then...

724
00:49:39,018 --> 00:49:40,268
...you are Mike Lowrey.

725
00:49:40,519 --> 00:49:42,562
You be him,
that's what you are.

726
00:49:42,813 --> 00:49:46,483
You're him. I don't want to hear it.
And you. You be you.

727
00:49:46,734 --> 00:49:49,903
But not in front of her.
You're him, you're you.

728
00:49:55,493 --> 00:49:58,912
Can we get a time-out?
Am I the designated homeless?

729
00:49:59,538 --> 00:50:03,750
Does it look like I care?
Whatever it takes, all right?

730
00:50:03,918 --> 00:50:05,001
What did she say to you?

731
00:50:05,294 --> 00:50:08,797
The shooters will make their drop
in 4 days? So we got 4 days.

732
00:50:09,423 --> 00:50:12,425
Captain, what kind of plan is that?

733
00:50:12,677 --> 00:50:14,594
I can't be shacked up
with that woman.

734
00:50:14,887 --> 00:50:18,306
I have a family to look after.
My wife will kill my ass.

735
00:50:19,058 --> 00:50:21,685
You don't like your job, quit.

736
00:50:23,771 --> 00:50:24,938
Damn.

737
00:50:26,899 --> 00:50:29,401
I'll stay at the house
with Theresa and the kids.

738
