01:21:48,237 --> 01:21:51,281
- Miami Police! Freeze!
- I am the police!

1224
01:21:51,448 --> 01:21:52,991
Marcus, what are you doing?

1225
01:21:53,242 --> 01:21:55,201
- You're doing Theresa.
- No, I'm not.

1226
01:21:55,411 --> 01:21:56,828
- You're doing my baby.
- Shut up.

1227
01:21:59,331 --> 01:22:02,083
We could sneak up and
snuff them both right now.

1228
01:22:02,293 --> 01:22:04,085
But we're suppose to get the girl.

1229
01:22:04,253 --> 01:22:07,130
Never fuck with
a cop's family, asshole.

1230
01:22:07,339 --> 01:22:09,173
- Doesn't that piss you off?
- Yeah.

1231
01:22:09,425 --> 01:22:12,010
Don't get me started.
Out of the car.

1232
01:22:13,012 --> 01:22:14,304
Motherfucker.

1233
01:22:14,513 --> 01:22:16,431
This whole shit is making you crazy.

1234
01:22:16,807 --> 01:22:19,517
You know it ain't nothing going on
between me and Theresa.

1235
01:22:23,147 --> 01:22:26,024
I've been your partner for six years...

1236
01:22:26,275 --> 01:22:28,109
...and your boy all my life.

1237
01:22:28,360 --> 01:22:29,986
For you to even think...

1238
01:22:30,237 --> 01:22:33,364
To let dumb shit
like that get in your mind.

1239
01:22:33,532 --> 01:22:35,366
This is me.
What's wrong with you?

1240
01:22:38,203 --> 01:22:39,245
Fucking...

1241
01:22:40,623 --> 01:22:41,831
I'm just...

1242
01:22:46,503 --> 01:22:48,046
I'm fine.

1243
01:22:48,881 --> 01:22:50,882
Get out of here.
Where's Julie?

1244
01:22:51,133 --> 01:22:53,468
She's in the car, handcuffed
to the steering wheel.

1245
01:22:53,719 --> 01:22:55,637
Are you trying to blow this case?

1246
01:22:55,846 --> 01:22:57,639
My bad.
I ain't had no quality time.

1247
01:22:57,848 --> 01:23:01,684
You know how it is.
Sometimes you do dumb shit.

1248
01:23:06,065 --> 01:23:08,733
- My bad, all right?
- It's cool, man.

1249
01:23:09,068 --> 01:23:11,194
Go, go. All right.

1250
01:23:14,865 --> 01:23:18,242
These phone calls were made
to Club Hell from this precinct.

1251
01:23:18,494 --> 01:23:20,078
Explain.

1252
01:23:20,412 --> 01:23:24,207
I'm gonna ask you one more time.
Give me a goddamn name!

1253
01:23:28,837 --> 01:23:31,047
- All I know is his name.
- Give me his name.

1254
01:23:31,340 --> 01:23:34,342
You're looking at a lot of time,
you know that?

1255
01:23:34,510 --> 01:23:36,094
Fouchet.

1256
01:23:36,387 --> 01:23:37,595
Fouchet, I think.

1257
01:23:37,888 --> 01:23:42,725
- That's his whole name, "Fouchet"?
- Fouchet. I'm just an errand boy.

1258
01:23:42,935 --> 01:23:44,811
Stop it, please. You'll make me cry.

1259
01:23:45,062 --> 01:23:47,730
I swear. Watching the house
was my first gig.

1260
01:23:47,940 --> 01:23:50,274
How sweet.
Does that make you union?

1261
01:23:51,110 --> 01:23:52,777
If you were a real cop...

1262
01:23:52,945 --> 01:23:55,071
...in the field, working every day...

1263
01:23:55,280 --> 01:23:58,825
...you'd realize shit happens.
- Don't give me that crap.

1264
01:23:59,034 --> 01:24:00,952
You're on your way
to being reassigned.

1265
01:24:01,245 --> 01:24:03,538
- Shut down.
- Who'll reassign me? You?

1266
01:24:03,747 --> 01:24:06,916
You don't have the authority
to reassign me. So until you do...

1267
01:24:07,084 --> 01:24:08,459
...stay the hell out of here.

1268
01:24:09,294 --> 01:24:11,963
They should just bone
and get that shit over with.

1269
01:24:12,548 --> 01:24:14,966
I'm getting really tired of this.

1270
01:24:15,217 --> 01:24:16,884
You're tired?

1271
01:24:19,304 --> 01:24:23,099
They're overfed, lazy.
We need video surveillance.

1272
01:24:23,308 --> 01:24:26,144
- These guard dogs are nothing.
- Jojo.

1273
01:24:26,353 --> 01:24:28,104
Don't make this hard.

1274
01:24:32,067 --> 01:24:33,985
Nice running into you, Jojo.

1275
01:24:34,278 --> 01:24:36,988
Always making it
hard on yourself, Jojo.

1276
01:24:37,239 --> 01:24:39,991
Gee, Julie, what have you been up to
the last couple of days?

1277
01:24:40,159 --> 01:24:43,453
Nothing. Just hanging out,
handcuffed to steering wheels.

1278
01:24:43,829 --> 01:24:46,873
We're looking for someone who could
step on a shit-load of heroin.

1279
01:24:47,124 --> 01:24:49,834
Do it real fast, real well.
We're looking for a real pro.

1280
01:24:50,002 --> 01:24:52,962
I told you,
I'm in the rubber business now.

1281
01:24:53,172 --> 01:24:55,631
Jojo, we're not playing, man.

1282
01:24:56,800 --> 01:24:58,760
I'm telling you, I'm straight.

1283
01:24:59,011 --> 01:25:02,930
I'm straight like a board, like an arrow.
I'm so straight, it's sick.

1284
01:25:03,599 --> 01:25:07,185
It's a lot of dope.
Who could cut it real quick?

1285
01:25:07,436 --> 01:25:09,812
Cut it?
You mean, cut it up?

1286
01:25:10,397 --> 01:25:12,440
I'm sick of this bullshit.

1287
01:25:13,817 --> 01:25:15,193
Bullshit.

1288
01:25:16,695 --> 01:25:19,363
- What's up?
- You're pulling a gun on me?

1289
01:25:19,615 --> 01:25:22,909
You're cops. I can't believe this.
I should turn you in to Hard Copy.

1290
01:25:23,118 --> 01:25:24,660
- Put your ass on TV.
- What you doing?

1291
01:25:24,828 --> 01:25:26,913
I got this. Jojo...

1292
01:25:27,915 --> 01:25:30,458
...I got 15 bullets in this gun.
- Mike.

1293
01:25:30,626 --> 01:25:34,879
If you don't start talking, I'll fill
your lying ass with some hot shit.

1294
01:25:35,130 --> 01:25:36,964
He's a former ganja-smoking fucker.

1295
01:25:37,174 --> 01:25:38,966
- He ain't worth it.
- You want some?

1296
01:25:39,176 --> 01:25:40,635
I'll bust your ass too!

1297
01:25:41,553 --> 01:25:42,970
So sad.

1298
01:25:43,222 --> 01:25:44,555
You're on your own.

1299
01:25:46,975 --> 01:25:49,227
- What's up, Jo?
- But I'll tell you like this...

1300
01:25:49,520 --> 01:25:52,855
...you splatter his ass,
he's no good to us. Fuck that.

1301
01:25:53,357 --> 01:25:55,525
Fuck that.
I'm not going down over this shit.

1302
01:25:55,692 --> 01:25:59,821
I'm not going down for you
killing Jojo the tire man.

1303
01:26:00,030 --> 01:26:04,492
I don't want no brain fragments on me.
It gets in your clothes and it stinks.

1304
01:26:05,452 --> 01:26:06,577
Fuck that.

1305
01:26:06,829 --> 01:26:10,540
I'll tell you what I know. I don't
know everything about everything.

1306
01:26:10,749 --> 01:26:13,584
- Tell him something.
- There's three guys.

1307
01:26:13,836 --> 01:26:16,546
They got a laboratory...
No, no.

1308
01:26:16,755 --> 01:26:20,383
Two guys. One guy died in
a plane crash last year.

1309
01:26:20,968 --> 01:26:22,260
used to be more.

1310
01:26:23,512 --> 01:26:26,764
No, it's one guy, really.
It's only one guy.

1311
01:26:27,349 --> 01:26:28,724
Don't fuck with me.

1312
01:26:28,976 --> 01:26:32,186
This guy's an Einstein,
genius college boy...

1313
01:26:32,437 --> 01:26:35,189
...egghead motherfucker.
He got glasses.

1314
01:26:35,440 --> 01:26:37,441
His rich parents
live in Coconut Grove.

1315
01:26:37,693 --> 01:26:39,735
Where? Tell him again, Jojo.

1316
01:26:39,945 --> 01:26:41,237
I'll tell you where.

1317
01:26:42,781 --> 01:26:44,282
You'd do that for us?

1318
01:26:44,992 --> 01:26:49,912
I want to help. Stick that gun down.
I got the address...

1319
01:26:50,122 --> 01:26:51,289
...in the...

1320
01:26:52,291 --> 01:26:53,499
...office.

1321
01:26:55,294 --> 01:26:58,379
- Thanks. Why don't you get it?
- Cool.

1322
01:26:58,547 --> 01:26:59,797
- Go.
- Now?

1323
01:27:00,048 --> 01:27:02,258
Now's good. Now is real good.

1324
01:27:02,509 --> 01:27:03,718
This is on me.

1325
01:27:03,969 --> 01:27:07,889
Why don't you pick out some
white walls? A gift from me to you.

1326
01:27:10,726 --> 01:27:13,644
You made me think
you were going to shoot me.

1327
01:27:13,896 --> 01:27:15,104
I was.

1328
01:27:18,150 --> 01:27:20,443
When's this punk-ass chemist
coming home?

1329
01:27:20,611 --> 01:27:22,111
So...

1330
01:27:22,571 --> 01:27:24,322
...this is a stakeout.

1331
01:27:24,573 --> 01:27:26,157
Not what I imagined.

1332
01:27:26,450 --> 01:27:29,118
Thought there'd be more conversation.

1333
01:27:29,536 --> 01:27:31,996
Sorry, it's not up to your...

1334
01:27:32,247 --> 01:27:33,831
...usual high standards.

1335
01:27:34,958 --> 01:27:36,834
Is he always like this on a stakeout?

1336
01:27:37,753 --> 01:27:40,796
What is it?
Too much caffeine?

1337
01:27:41,006 --> 01:27:42,548
Not enough sex?

1338
01:27:42,758 --> 01:27:44,842
I can't believe she went there.

1339
01:27:45,844 --> 01:27:47,803
You don't know who
you talking to?

1340
01:27:48,055 --> 01:27:50,306
That's Mike Lowrey over there.

1341
01:27:51,433 --> 01:27:53,309
King Ding-a-ling.

1342
01:27:53,518 --> 01:27:55,811
Why don't you whip it out
for her, big boy?

1343
01:27:56,021 --> 01:27:58,022
Yeah, right on your forehead.

1344
01:27:58,190 --> 01:27:59,357
Shut up.

1345
01:28:08,951 --> 01:28:10,159
There he is.
Let's go.

1346
01:28:10,369 --> 01:28:12,078
- Let's go.
- I'm on him.

1347
01:28:26,385 --> 01:28:27,885
What are our chances?

1348
01:28:28,387 --> 01:28:30,012
Remember Club Hell?

1349
01:28:30,389 --> 01:28:31,389
Worse.

1350
01:28:33,392 --> 01:28:35,059
That's it. Call major backup.

1351
01:28:35,227 --> 01:28:38,020
I want motherfucking
swimming ducks in here.

1352
01:28:38,230 --> 01:28:39,480
Hold it.

1353
01:28:39,690 --> 01:28:44,402
Sinclair tapped every phones in
the station. We must do that in person.

1354
01:28:44,820 --> 01:28:47,488
Shit. By the time we deal
with her bullshit...

1355
01:28:47,698 --> 01:28:50,825
...every junkie in America
will be high off our bust.

1356
01:28:52,494 --> 01:28:53,995
Can we help you?

1357
01:28:54,246 --> 01:28:59,041
I staked out all night
in that jalopy too. I earned a peek.

1358
01:28:59,751 --> 01:29:03,546
This is real cop stuff, okay?
This is not Charlie's Angels.

1359
01:29:03,755 --> 01:29:06,090
Can't hurt for her to take a peek.

1360
01:29:06,258 --> 01:29:10,219
It can't hurt to look?
If they fire a bullet over here, it'll hurt.

1361
01:29:18,645 --> 01:29:20,146
We have guests.

1362
01:29:20,772 --> 01:29:21,772
Have them followed.

1363
01:29:21,940 --> 01:29:24,358
Don't do anything,
just call me with their location.

1364
01:29:30,115 --> 01:29:34,618
This high-speed chase, ending
near River and 34th Streets...

1365
01:29:34,870 --> 01:29:37,538
...was captured 2 nights ago
by our news team.

1366
01:29:38,665 --> 01:29:40,166
Mom!

1367
01:29:43,295 --> 01:29:45,296
You said Daddy was in Cleveland.

1368
01:29:45,756 --> 01:29:49,425
- Can't be in Cleveland.
- The officers didn't like our cameras.

1369
01:29:49,593 --> 01:29:52,303
No. Your daddy just wishes
he was in Cleveland.

1370
01:29:52,971 --> 01:29:56,432
I'm telling you, this Fouchet,
he's slick.

1371
01:29:57,684 --> 01:30:00,644
FBI, DEA, they got nothing on him.

1372
01:30:00,812 --> 01:30:03,314
But he got to deal with us today.

1373
01:30:14,201 --> 01:30:15,701
What's that?

1374
01:30:15,911 --> 01:30:19,997
That's the last time they handcuff me.
That's what that is.

1375
01:30:20,248 --> 01:30:21,707
Good boy.

1376
01:30:23,460 --> 01:30:25,669
Excuse me, ma'am. Ma'am.

1377
01:30:25,837 --> 01:30:28,005
All visitors must be announced.

1378
01:30:28,256 --> 01:30:29,715
Pisses me off.

1379
01:30:30,092 --> 01:30:31,801
Lady. Lady.

1380
01:30:33,220 --> 01:30:36,514
When you get back,
this'll be over, right?

1381
01:30:36,723 --> 01:30:38,099
You got that right.

1382
01:30:38,350 --> 01:30:41,477
Now don't worry.
You'll be set free.

1383
01:30:41,728 --> 01:30:42,770
Cut loose.

1384
01:30:43,021 --> 01:30:45,773
You'll be back to your own life.

1385
01:30:46,858 --> 01:30:48,859
No more handcuffs.

1386
01:30:53,156 --> 01:30:56,700
- I'm out of here.
- That's Chet with my veggie burger.

1387
01:30:56,952 --> 01:30:59,036
- Move your ass.
- You got it.

1388
01:31:02,749 --> 01:31:04,458
Hi, can I help you?

1389
01:31:04,668 --> 01:31:07,711
I'm here to kill
my husband, Marcus Burnett.

1390
01:31:07,879 --> 01:31:10,714
The tall one,
or the short one?

1391
01:31:10,966 --> 01:31:12,174
The short one.

1392
01:31:13,135 --> 01:31:14,385
Thought so.

1393
01:31:14,803 --> 01:31:16,137
Is Chet ringing...

1394
01:31:16,388 --> 01:31:17,972
Oh, babe.

1395
01:31:24,229 --> 01:31:27,982
- Let me get your husband.
- Marcus, get over here.

1396
01:31:29,067 --> 01:31:34,321
I know what it looks like.
Did you get my message?

1397
01:31:37,200 --> 01:31:38,784
Can you...

1398
01:31:38,994 --> 01:31:40,494
...leave me and...

1399
01:31:40,704 --> 01:31:42,580
...Mrs. Burnett alone?

1400
01:31:43,081 --> 01:31:44,415
Right.

1401
01:31:46,209 --> 01:31:47,585
Y'all met?

1402
01:31:48,295 --> 01:31:49,420
Baby...

1403
01:31:50,297 --> 01:31:52,298
I know... Let me...

1404
01:31:52,507 --> 01:31:56,802
As far as I'm concerned, keep the
wedding ring in your pocket...

1405
01:31:57,053 --> 01:31:58,721
...because you, your girlfriend...

1406
01:31:58,930 --> 01:32:00,514
Oh, shit.

1407
01:32:00,765 --> 01:32:03,767
- and Mike will be
very happy living here.

1408
01:32:03,935 --> 01:32:05,769
Sweetie. Sweetie, honey.

1409
01:32:09,566 --> 01:32:11,692
No, no, I saw it on the news.

1410
01:32:12,319 --> 01:32:15,446
That shit be having a slant.

1411
01:32:17,532 --> 01:32:19,450
You're no longer welcome
to my house.

1412
01:32:19,618 --> 01:32:22,453
He didn't tell you
I was coming in the airport early?

1413
01:32:22,746 --> 01:32:25,873
Remember, I said call,
and that you'd bring me to your place?

1414
01:32:26,374 --> 01:32:28,042
Tell her what I told you?

1415
01:32:28,293 --> 01:32:30,878
- You were gonna bring me here...
- Julie!

1416
01:32:33,256 --> 01:32:35,132
I ain't even going to...

1417
01:32:35,550 --> 01:32:36,967
We're not arguing.

1418
01:32:37,135 --> 01:32:38,469
I'm raising my...

1419
01:32:38,762 --> 01:32:40,221
All right... Baby.

1420
01:32:40,430 --> 01:32:41,972
Believe me, we wanted to tell you.

1421
01:32:42,265 --> 01:32:47,102
It really doesn't matter, Marcus...
Mike, Kojak, whatever your name is.

1422
01:32:47,479 --> 01:32:49,647
I'll tell you something else:

1423
01:32:49,940 --> 01:32:53,901
If his wife can find us,
I'm better off on my own.

1424
01:32:54,110 --> 01:32:55,402
This...

1425
01:32:55,737 --> 01:32:57,404
I can see how it'd look a trip.

1426
01:32:58,490 --> 01:33:01,408
You see me, I run out,
I got a shirt open.

1427
01:33:01,660 --> 01:33:03,410
You see Mike half-naked.

1428
01:33:03,620 --> 01:33:05,621
Then you see the white girl.

1429
01:33:05,872 --> 01:33:10,000
It looks like we having an orgy,
and ain't nobody humped.

1430
01:33:10,293 --> 01:33:12,670
Ain't nobody doing none of that.

1431
01:33:12,879 --> 01:33:15,506
It's not what it looks like, okay?

1432
01:33:15,840 --> 01:33:18,175
Baby, she's a material witness.

1433
01:33:19,177 --> 01:33:20,886
That's real.

1434
01:33:21,096 --> 01:33:22,763
Baby, Theresa, listen.

1435
01:33:22,973 --> 01:33:25,599
It was orders.
Listen, it was orders.

1436
01:33:27,143 --> 01:33:31,105
Can I talk to you?
Can you stop so I can talk to you?

1437
01:33:31,314 --> 01:33:34,692
Enough smooth shit, Mike.
It's not going to work anymore.

1438
01:33:44,035 --> 01:33:46,036
I don't care what you say.

1439
01:33:51,710 --> 01:33:52,835
Duck.

1440
01:33:53,044 --> 01:33:54,295
Julie, get down!

1441
01:33:54,504 --> 01:33:55,629
Get down!

1442
01:34:27,245 --> 01:34:28,495
Get out!

1443
01:34:35,920 --> 01:34:37,504
911!

1444
01:34:41,009 --> 01:34:42,760
911? Chet here.

1445
01:34:42,969 --> 01:34:45,095
Go upstairs and take this.
Take it!

1446
01:34:47,515 --> 01:34:50,267
I'll keep everybody calm
until my backup arrive.

1447
01:34:50,518 --> 01:34:52,061
I love you.

1448
01:34:53,438 --> 01:34:55,105
I forgot to give them the address.

1449
01:35:31,309 --> 01:35:32,810
Go, go, go!

1450
01:35:32,977 --> 01:35:34,019
Watch out!

1451
01:35:34,229 --> 01:35:35,646
Keep going.

1452
01:35:38,149 --> 01:35:39,149
Get her in.

1453
01:36:08,054 --> 01:36:09,179
Move!

1454
01:36:22,944 --> 01:36:23,986
It's okay.

1455
01:36:24,195 --> 01:36:27,072
I'm with the police. It's cool.
You look great.

1456
01:36:54,225 --> 01:36:55,309
Drive!

1457
01:37:31,429 --> 01:37:33,764
Don't ever say I wasn't there for you.

1458
01:37:46,945 --> 01:37:48,070
What is it with you?

1459
01:37:48,279 --> 01:37:50,447
How come it always has to be
good news/bad news?

1460
01:37:50,698 --> 01:37:54,076
You know where the dope is,
but you lose our witness.

1461
01:37:54,285 --> 01:37:56,954
- I don't get it.
- Lowrey, pick up your phone.

1462
01:37:58,540 --> 01:38:00,082
- Lowrey.
- Hi, Mr. Lowrey.

1463
01:38:00,250 --> 01:38:04,795
I'm keeping your friend for 4 hours,
until I make my deal.

1464
01:38:04,963 --> 01:38:07,130
And I will make my deal.

1465
01:38:07,298 --> 01:38:09,299
I just put a bullet in the chemist...

1466
01:38:09,592 --> 01:38:12,261
...who fucked with my timetable.

